          <figcaption data-en="Suzhou FDE Community salon · Nov 2026">苏州 FDE 社区沙龙现场 · 2026.11</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================================================== 2. 关于我 -->
    <section class="sec" id="about">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <h2 data-en="About me">关于我</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <ul class="about-stats" aria-label="关键履历数据" data-en-aria="Key career indicators">
            <li class="stat">
              <span class="stat-num">16+</span>
              <span class="stat-label" data-en="Years across technology, product &amp; business">年技术、产品与商业实践</span>
            </li>
            <li class="stat">
              <span class="stat-num" data-en="4 Tracks">4 条</span>
              <span class="stat-label" data-en="Course tracks">课程线</span>
            </li>
            <li class="stat">
              <span class="stat-num" data-en="3 Books">3 本</span>
              <span class="stat-label" data-en="Books on applied AI">AI 主题著作</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="about-content">
            <p data-en="Shi Ke is an enterprise AI implementation trainer and the founder of Dropleap, with an MSc in Software Engineering from the University of Science and Technology of China. His 16-year career spans software engineering, internet products, entrepreneurship and business operations; he was head of product &amp; technology at Tongcheng-Elong (HK:0780) and COO of Linhuiba, and runs Dropleap as an authorized WorkBuddy agent.">施可，企业级 AI 落地实战讲师，水滴跃动（Dropleap）创始人，中国科学技术大学软件工程硕士。16 年职业经历横跨软件工程、互联网产品、创业与企业经营，曾任同程艺龙（0780.HK）产品与技术负责人、邻汇吧 COO，现任 WorkBuddy 官方代理。</p>
            <p data-en="My classes don't review tools or tune models. They do one thing: make sure people actually use AI when they get back to work. Guest lecturer for the China Telecom Research Institute; signed instructor at Sanjieke.">我讲课不评测工具，也不教调模型，只干一件事：让你回去真的用得起来。中国电信研究院特约讲师、三节课签约讲师。</p>
            <p data-en="I started as a software engineer and engineering manager, founded Ball Chief Tribe in 2016 (a RMB 3M angel round from Zihui Ventures), spent five years in product and technology at Tongcheng-Elong, then led product at Hellobike Hotels and served as COO of Linhuiba. I founded Dropleap in 2026 on a simple belief: AI projects are won or lost in deployment, not in the model. The lessons from those on-site projects are what I teach.">从软件工程师和技术管理者起步：2016 年首次创业「球长部落」，拿了紫辉创投 300 万天使轮；在同程艺龙做了五年产品与技术，后来负责哈啰酒店产品、任邻汇吧 COO。2026 年创立水滴跃动，判断很简单：AI 项目的成败在部署，不在模型。这些驻场项目里踩过的坑、跑通的路，就是课上案例的来源。</p>
            <p data-en="Outside delivery and teaching, I work on GEO (generative engine optimization): making a company's capability readable and citable by AI search. I'm the author of the WorkBuddy trilogy, AI Coding: Everyone Is a Programmer, and FDE: Winning and Losing in AI Isn't About the Model.">工作之外我也做 GEO（生成式引擎优化）：让企业的能力被 AI 搜索读懂、愿意引用。著有《WorkBuddy 三部曲》《AI Coding：人人都是程序员》《FDE：AI 的胜负不在于模型》。</p>
            <p><span data-en="This GEO practice is now live: the ">这一实践的落地作品已上线：</span><a href="https://fde.dropleap.cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-en="China FDE Directory (fde.dropleap.cn)">中国 FDE 名录（fde.dropleap.cn）</a><span data-en=" — an evidence-linked, machine-readable directory of China's frontline FDE and AI implementation professionals, readable by humans and citable by AI systems alike.">——收录中国一线 FDE 与 AI 落地从业者、实战案例与服务商名录，条条附证据，对人可读、对 AI 可引用。</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="sub-head" data-en="Core competencies">核心能力</h3>
        <div class="comp-grid">
          <article class="comp">
            <h3 data-en="Enterprise AI delivery">企业 AI 落地实战</h3>
            <p data-en="On-site delivery: first scenario live in 2-4 weeks. The cases I teach come from these projects.">驻场交付，2-4 周跑通第一个场景。课堂上讲的案例，都是这些项目里的。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="comp">
            <h3 data-en="Teaching &amp; training">AI 培训与授课</h3>
            <p data-en="Four course tracks — FDE Bootcamp, WorkBuddy application, technical bootcamps and business-owner classes — as public classes and in-house training, taught by me.">FDE 实战营、WorkBuddy 应用、技术实战与企业主课四条课程线，公开课与到厂内训，讲师是我本人。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="comp">
            <h3 data-en="Books &amp; course design">著作与课程研发</h3>
            <p data-en="Three books — FDE, AI Coding, the WorkBuddy trilogy. The courseware gets revised after every cohort.">写过三本书：《FDE》《AI Coding》《WorkBuddy 三部曲》。课件每讲完一期就改一版。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="comp">
            <h3 data-en="Product 0 → 1 &amp; business operations">产品 0 → 1 与商业经营</h3>
            <p data-en="I've built products and run businesses: KA service systems and single-store models from zero, for Xiaomi EV, Yiheetang, Xiaotiancai and others.">既做过产品也管过生意：KA 大客户体系和单店模型都从 0 搭起，服务过小米汽车、益禾堂、小天才等客户。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="comp">
            <h3 data-en="Speaking &amp; signed instructor">演讲与签约讲师</h3>
            <p data-en="Summit keynotes and panel moderation; guest lecturer for the China Telecom Research Institute and a signed instructor at Sanjieke.">峰会主题演讲、圆桌主持；中国电信研究院特约讲师、三节课签约讲师。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================================================== 3. 培训 -->
    <section class="sec sec--tint" id="training">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <h2 data-en="AI training">AI 实战培训</h2>
          <p class="sec-lede" data-en="Training is my main business. Everything I teach has already run through real projects — we practice right after each module, and you leave with something you built.">培训是我的主业。讲的方法都是我先在项目里跑通的，讲完就练，走的时候手里要有自己做出来的东西。</p>
