            <h3 data-en="WorkBuddy application track">WorkBuddy 应用线</h3>
            <p class="course-line-desc" data-en="One course for all staff (6 hours, 30–80 per session), one for admins (2 days). The goal: turn personal AI skills into something the team keeps using.">全员课 6 小时（单场 30–80 人），管理员课 2 天。目标就一个：从个人会用到团队留得下一套东西。</p>
            <div class="skill-tags">
