    <section class="sec sec--tint" id="work">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <h2 data-en="Field delivery">实战交付</h2>
          <p class="sec-lede" data-en="In Suzhou, delivering AI for manufacturing with a small team.">在苏州，带着小团队做制造业的 AI 落地。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="work-intro">
          <p data-en="In 2026 I founded Dropleap. As an authorized WorkBuddy agent, I help manufacturers get their first AI scenario live in 2-4 weeks — on site, moving to the next step only after the first one is accepted. The cases and exercises in my courses come from these projects.">2026 年我创立水滴跃动（Dropleap），作为 WorkBuddy 官方代理，帮制造企业在 2-4 周内跑通第一个 AI 场景。驻场交付，第一个场景验收合格后再谈下一步。课上用的案例和练习素材，就从这些项目里来。</p>
          <p class="work-intro-link">
            <a href="https://dropleap.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-en="Full product and case details on dropleap.cn ↗">完整的产品与案例在 dropleap.cn ↗</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="sub-head" data-en="Two core skills">两个核心 Skill</h3>
        <div class="prod-skills">
          <article class="prod-skill">
            <div class="prod-skill-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle>
                <path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path>
                <path d="M8 11h6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 data-en="Data Retrieval Skill">智能取数 Skill</h3>
            <p data-en="Turns natural-language questions into queries across systems — no report requests, no waiting.">把自然语言问题变成数据查询，跨系统取数，不用提报表需求、不用等。</p>
            <ul>
              <li data-en="Read-only access to existing systems">只读打通现有系统</li>
              <li data-en="Cross-system queries (CRM + ERP + MES)">跨系统联合查询</li>
              <li data-en="Daily operational reports auto-pushed">每日经营报告自动推送</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="prod-skill">
            <div class="prod-skill-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H19v15H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 20.5z"></path>
                <path d="M4 20.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 18H19v3H6.5"></path>
                <path d="M9 8h6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 data-en="Knowledge Base Skill">知识库 Skill</h3>
            <p data-en="Digitizes master craftsmen's experience, SOPs, product specs and process documents into a searchable base with citations.">把老师傅经验、SOP、产品规格、工艺文档数字化，可检索、附出处。</p>
            <ul>
              <li data-en="Master-craftsperson experience digitized">老师傅经验数字化沉淀</li>
              <li data-en="SOP / spec / process-doc Q&amp;A">SOP / 规格 / 工艺 Q&amp;A</li>
              <li data-en="New-hire ramp-up from months to days">新人上手从月到天</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>

        <h3 class="sub-head" data-en="Two projects already running">两个已经跑起来的项目</h3>
        <p class="sub-note" data-en="Client names are anonymized by agreement.">客户名称按约定匿名。</p>
        <div class="case-list">

          <article class="case">
